                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W6128800                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  SKAPAR BINNING PRODUCTIVITY REPORT                    *        
*                REDOVISNINGSPERIOD                                             
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  BODIL LINDAHL                                         *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W61288D1                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W61208  'IN-'                                                                  
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
FILE W61288D3  PRINTER FB (121 0)                                               
FILE W61288D5  PRINTER FB (121 0)                                               
*                                                                               
FILE W61288D6  PRINTER VB (125 0)                                               
FILE W61288D7  PRINTER VB (125 0)                                               
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
PROGRAM-NAMN      W   6   A   VALUE 'W61288'                                    
DATUMKORT-ID      W   6   A   VALUE 'WDATUM'                                    
WS-TIAARP         W   4   N                                                     
                                                                                
%WDATKORT 'DATKORT-'                                                            
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
WDATKONV          W  8  A   VALUE 'WDATKONV'                                    
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
%WDATAREA                                                                       
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
INNEV-AAVV        W                4  N                                         
INNEV-AA          INNEV-AAVV       2  N                                         
INNEV-VV          INNEV-AAVV    +2 2  N                                         
*                                                                               
INNEV-AARP        W                4  N                                         
INNEV-AA-RP       INNEV-AARP       2  N                                         
INNEV-RP          INNEV-AARP    +2 2  N                                         
*                                                                               
WS-IDDC           W 2 A                                                         
WS-ADLAGOMR-1     W 5 N MASK 'ZZZZ9'                                            
WS-ADLAGOMR-2     W 5 N MASK 'ZZZZ9'                                            
WS-ADLAGOMR-3     W 5 N MASK 'ZZZZ9'                                            
WS-ADLAGOMR-4     W 5 N MASK 'ZZZZ9'                                            
WS-ADLAGOMR-9     W 5 N MASK 'ZZZZ9'                                            
WS-ADLAGOMR-OVR   W 5 N MASK 'ZZZZ9'                                            
WS-KVRADER-BIN    W 5 N MASK 'ZZZZ9'                                            
WS-KVRADER-SHORT  W 5 N MASK 'ZZZZ9'                                            
WS-KVRADER-OVER   W 5 N MASK 'ZZZZ9'                                            
WS-KVRADER-DAM    W 5 N MASK 'ZZZZ9'                                            
WS-PREV-IDDC      W 2 A       VALUE '  '                                        
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
*    --- VALID IDDC CODES                                                       
*                                                                               
%WWDC99                                                                         
*                                                                               
*    --- TO CHECK IF "WEB DC"                                                   
*                                                                               
%WL10WBDC                                                                       
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
************************************************************************        
* SKAPAR LISTA                                                                  
************************************************************************        
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W61288D1) +                                                          
    START (A-INIT)                                                              
                                                                                
    WS-KVRADER-BIN   = IN-KVRADER-BIN                                           
    WS-KVRADER-SHORT = IN-KVRADER-SHORT                                         
    WS-KVRADER-OVER  = IN-KVRADER-OVER                                          
    WS-KVRADER-DAM   = IN-KVRADER-DAM                                           
    WS-ADLAGOMR-1 = IN-KVANTAL-1                                                
    WS-ADLAGOMR-2 = IN-KVANTAL-2                                                
    WS-ADLAGOMR-3 = IN-KVANTAL-3                                                
    WS-ADLAGOMR-4 = IN-KVANTAL-4                                                
    WS-ADLAGOMR-9 = IN-KVANTAL-9                                                
    WS-ADLAGOMR-OVR = IN-KVANTAL-OVR                                            
    MOVE IN-IDDC TO WS-IDDC                                                     
    PERFORM S23-CHECK-WS-IDDC                                                   
                                                                                
    WBDC-IDDC = IN-IDDC                                                         
    CALL WL10WBDC USING WBDC-AREA                                               
                                                                                
*   IF WS-IDDC = SDC-GB                                                         
**     PRINT W61288-001                                                         
**  ELSE                                                                        
       IF WS-IDDC = NDC-US-RU                                                   
          PRINT W61288-002                                                      
       ELSE                                                                     
**        IF WS-IDDC = NDC-US-AT                                                
**           PRINT W61288-003                                                   
**        ELSE                                                                  
**         IF WS-IDDC = NDC-US-LA                                               
**              PRINT W61288-004                                                
**           ELSE                                                               
                IF WS-IDDC = CDC-SE                                             
                   PRINT W61288-011                                             
                ELSE                                                            
                   IF WBDC-FLWEBDC = 'J'                                        
                      PRINT W61289-005                                          
                   END-IF                                                       
**              END-IF                                                          
**           END-IF                                                             
          END-IF                                                                
       END-IF                                                                   
**  END-IF                                                                      
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
A-INIT. PROC                                                                    
*                                                                               
  CALL DATKORT  USING (PROGRAM-NAMN +                                           
                       DATUMKORT-ID +                                           
                       DATKORT-DATUMKORT)                                       
*                                                                               
  INNEV-AA = DATKORT-D-AAR                                                      
  INNEV-VV = DATKORT-D-VECKA                                                    
                                                                                
  DAT-I-TIDATUM = INNEV-AAVV                                                    
  DAT-KDDATFORM = 'AAVV'                                                        
  CALL WDATKONV USING (DAT-KDDATFORM, DAT-I-TIDATUM, DAT-O-TIDATUM,  +          
                      DAT-KDSVAR)                                               
  INNEV-AARP = DAT-TIAARP                                                       
  DISPLAY ' INNEVARANDE PERIOD ' INNEV-AARP                                     
                                                                                
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
%WWDC02  'WS-'                                                                  
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
REPORT   W61288-002 PRINTER W61288D3 LINESIZE 120 DTLCTL FIRST +                
         NOADJUST NOHEADING TITLESKIP 2 PAGESIZE 41                             
                                                                                
TITLE 1  COL 12  'VCCS W61288-002'                                              
                                                                                
TITLE 3  COL 12  'MONTHLY BINNING PRODUCTIVITY REPORT'     +                    
         COL 49  'DC 41'                                   +                    
         COL 56  'PERIOD'                                  +                    
         COL 63  DAT-TIAARP                                                     
                                                                                
TITLE 5  COL 4  'BINNER'                          +                             
         COL 13 'BINNED'                          +                             
         COL 23 'LINES'                           +                             
         COL 33 'LINES'                           +                             
         COL 43 'LINES'                           +                             
         COL 53 'LINES/AREA'                                                    
                                                                                
TITLE 6  COL 4  'NO'                              +                             
         COL 13 'LINES'                           +                             
         COL 23 'SHORT'                           +                             
         COL 33 'OVER'                            +                             
         COL 43 'DAM'                             +                             
         COL 53 '1X'                              +                             
         COL 61 '2X'                              +                             
         COL 69 '3X'                              +                             
         COL 77 '4X'                              +                             
         COL 85 '9X'                              +                             
         COL 93 'OTHER'                                                         
                                                                                
LINE 1   COL 4   IN-IDUSER-003    +                                             
         COL 13  WS-KVRADER-BIN   +                                             
         COL 23  WS-KVRADER-SHORT +                                             
         COL 33  WS-KVRADER-OVER  +                                             
         COL 43  WS-KVRADER-DAM   +                                             
         COL 53  WS-ADLAGOMR-1    +                                             
         COL 61  WS-ADLAGOMR-2    +                                             
         COL 69  WS-ADLAGOMR-3    +                                             
         COL 77  WS-ADLAGOMR-4    +                                             
         COL 85  WS-ADLAGOMR-9    +                                             
         COL 93  WS-ADLAGOMR-OVR                                                
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
REPORT   W61288-004 PRINTER W61288D5 LINESIZE 120 DTLCTL FIRST +                
         NOADJUST NOHEADING TITLESKIP 2 PAGESIZE 41                             
                                                                                
TITLE 1  COL 12  'VCCS W61288-004'                                              
                                                                                
TITLE 3  COL 12  'MONTHLY BINNING PRODUCTIVITY REPORT'     +                    
         COL 49  'DC 43'                                   +                    
         COL 56  'PERIOD'                                  +                    
         COL 63  DAT-TIAARP                                                     
                                                                                
TITLE 5  COL 4  'BINNER'                          +                             
         COL 13 'BINNED'                          +                             
         COL 23 'LINES'                           +                             
         COL 33 'LINES'                           +                             
         COL 43 'LINES'                           +                             
         COL 53 'LINES/AREA'                                                    
                                                                                
TITLE 6  COL 4  'NO'                              +                             
         COL 13 'LINES'                           +                             
         COL 23 'SHORT'                           +                             
         COL 33 'OVER'                            +                             
         COL 43 'DAM'                             +                             
         COL 53 '1X'                              +                             
         COL 61 '2X'                              +                             
         COL 69 '3X'                              +                             
         COL 77 '4X'                              +                             
         COL 85 '9X'                              +                             
         COL 93 'OTHER'                                                         
                                                                                
LINE 1   COL 4   IN-IDUSER-003    +                                             
         COL 13  WS-KVRADER-BIN   +                                             
         COL 23  WS-KVRADER-SHORT +                                             
         COL 33  WS-KVRADER-OVER  +                                             
         COL 43  WS-KVRADER-DAM   +                                             
         COL 53  WS-ADLAGOMR-1    +                                             
         COL 61  WS-ADLAGOMR-2    +                                             
         COL 69  WS-ADLAGOMR-3    +                                             
         COL 77  WS-ADLAGOMR-4    +                                             
         COL 85  WS-ADLAGOMR-9    +                                             
         COL 93  WS-ADLAGOMR-OVR                                                
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
REPORT   W61289-005 PRINTER W61288D6 LINESIZE 120 DTLCTL FIRST +                
         NOADJUST NOHEADING SPACE 0 TITLESKIP 2 PAGESIZE 41                     
                                                                                
LINE 1   IN-IDDC          +                                                     
         INNEV-AARP       +                                                     
         IN-IDUSER-003    +                                                     
         WS-KVRADER-BIN   +                                                     
         WS-KVRADER-SHORT +                                                     
         WS-KVRADER-OVER  +                                                     
         WS-KVRADER-DAM   +                                                     
         WS-ADLAGOMR-1    +                                                     
         WS-ADLAGOMR-2    +                                                     
         WS-ADLAGOMR-3    +                                                     
         WS-ADLAGOMR-4    +                                                     
         WS-ADLAGOMR-9    +                                                     
         WS-ADLAGOMR-OVR                                                        
*                                                                               
BEFORE-LINE. PROC                                                               
  IF WBDC-IDDC NE WS-PREV-IDDC                                                  
    DISPLAY '¤DAPW61289-005'                                                    
    DISPLAY '¤DAP' WBDC-IDDC                                                    
    WS-PREV-IDDC = WBDC-IDDC                                                    
  END-IF                                                                        
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
